---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use — CalcBox"
  description="Review the terms and conditions for using CalcBox calculators, tools, and conversion utilities."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Usage Agreement</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm text-gray-700 space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using CalcBox ("the Website"), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Use and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue using our tools.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">2. Informational and Educational Purpose Only</h2>
        <p>
          All calculators, numerical estimation tools, and unit converters provided on CalcBox are intended solely for general informational, planning, and educational purposes. While we endeavor to ensure mathematical precision and accurate implementations:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
          <li><strong>No Financial Advice:</strong> Financial tools (including Loan EMI calculators, Compound Interest calculators, and Discount estimators) are approximations. They do not constitute certified financial, tax, legal, or investment advice. Actual loan terms depend on your lending institution's compounding methods, fees, and credit assessments.</li>
          <li><strong>No Medical Advice:</strong> Health calculators (including Body Mass Index / BMI) provide general statistical metrics based on population formulas. They do not consider body composition, muscle mass, age factors, or clinical health markers. Always consult a qualified physician or healthcare provider for medical diagnosis.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall CalcBox, its authors, or operators be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, the calculations or information provided on this site. You use these calculations at your own discretion and risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">4. Intellectual Property & Fair Use</h2>
        <p>
          The layout, branding, logos, design elements, and custom code of CalcBox are the intellectual property of CalcBox. You may freely use our calculators for personal or business calculations. However, automated scraping, mirroring, or unauthorized reproduction of the website's assets without written consent is prohibited.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">5. Modifications to the Service</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to add, update, modify, or retire any calculator or feature at any time without prior notice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">6. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Use are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable standard legal frameworks. Any inquiries regarding these terms can be directed via our <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-600 underline">Contact Page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
